    "detailed_description": "You woke up in an abandoned space station<br>You need to somehow try to get out of this inhospitable place that is teeming with dangerous creatures<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Auto-firing main and secondary weapons<br></li><li> Semi-automatic laser turrets: your only allies that differ from map to map<br></li><li> One active skill \u2014 jetpack dash<br></li><li> Many jet backpacks to choose from with different slots, stats and mechanics!<br></li><li> Free stats upgrades after every level up<br></li><li> A lot of items available to buy in the shop between waves<br></li><li> Waves system with rounds 20-100 sec</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "You woke up in an abandoned space station<br>You need to somehow try to get out of this inhospitable place that is teeming with dangerous creatures<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Auto-firing main and secondary weapons<br></li><li> Semi-automatic laser turrets: your only allies that differ from map to map<br></li><li> One active skill \u2014 jetpack dash<br></li><li> Many jet backpacks to choose from with different slots, stats and mechanics!<br></li><li> Free stats upgrades after every level up<br></li><li> A lot of items available to buy in the shop between waves<br></li><li> Waves system with rounds 20-100 sec</li></ul>",
